      },
      "source": {
        "name": "BBC Rugby Union"
      }
    },
    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-18",
      "edition": "Wednesday 18 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection policy",
          "heading": "Laurent Sempéré rules out rotating France's side against Argentina with final in sight",
          "body": "Asked whether France would rest players against Argentina with a possible Grand Final at Twickenham to come, France assistant coach Laurent Sempéré said rotation was not something the staff were considering. Every player had shown in training that he could take the jersey, he said, and Saturday's side would be the most competitive available. All players in camp can train, though workloads have been adjusted for those who have played a lot. A bonus-point win over the Pumas would guarantee France's place in the final."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Japan lose 15-78 to England in Nations Championship",
