        "name": "Federazione Italiana Rugby"
      }
    },
    "390": {
      "date": "2026-11-18",
      "edition": "Wednesday 18 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Bench impact",
          "heading": "Max Williamson says he thrives on physical battle after flattening Harry Wilson",
          "body": "Max Williamson made the most of an unplanned outing in Sunday's 15-12 win over Australia at Murrayfield. The Scotland lock came on in the first half when Scott Cummings was forced off injured, and buried Wallabies captain Harry Wilson with a hit. He now says the physical contest is where he is at his best. Cummings has since returned to Glasgow with leg damage and misses Saturday's Japan game. Edinburgh's Grant Gilchrist and Leicester Tigers lock Cam Henderson are among the call-ups."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Japan lose 15-78 to England in Nations Championship",
          "body": "Argentina beat Italy 19-14 in Nations Championship. Fiji confirm Quad Series to replace Pacific Nations Cup."
        }
      ],
      "match": {
