      }
    },
    "391": {
      "date": "2026-11-18",
      "edition": "Wednesday 18 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Back to work",
          "heading": "Wales squad shown fans' reaction to All Blacks win, says Matt Sherratt",
          "body": "Head coach Steve Tandy's squad returned to training on Monday, 48 hours after the 35-28 win over New Zealand, having been given time off to enjoy the result with their families. One team meeting included a video of what the victory meant to supporters, and Wales assistant coach Matt Sherratt said: \"The boys loved watching some of the videos we've seen, some of the memes online about people's reactions in their living rooms.\" Attention now turns to Saturday's visit of Australia to Cardiff."
        },
