          "kicker": "TV audience",
          "heading": "Pumas' Genoa win over Italy draws 314,483 viewers on Italian television",
          "body": "Free-to-air channel TV8 accounted for 208,967 of that audience for Argentina's 19-14 Nations Championship win in Genoa, with 89,931 more watching Sky Sport Uno's simulcast and 15,585 on Sky Sport Arena, according to OnRugby. The total topped the 294,345 who saw Italy's meeting with South Africa a week earlier, and dwarfed every other fifth-round fixture on Italian screens — Wales' win over New Zealand drew 60,883. Head coach Felipe Contepomi's side face France in Paris next."
        },
