          "kicker": "Final round",
          "heading": "Japan take fifth Southern Hemisphere spot into Murrayfield group-stage finale",
          "body": "Under head coach Eddie Jones, Japan close the Nations Championship group stage on five points. This round's results settle the pairings for the placement finals at Twickenham a week later. Their Murrayfield opponents, Scotland head coach Gregor Townsend's side, edged Australia 15-12 last week and sit fourth in the Northern Hemisphere standings on 15 points. Japan arrive off a 15-78 hammering by England."
        },
